gging; Commvault's Cloud Rewind for data recovery with automated cloud application and infrastructure rebuild capabilities; and Commvault's Clumio Backtrack to revert cloud objects and datasets to a prior point in time. Further, the company provides professional and customer support services comprising real-time support, support engineers, customer success options, technology consulting services, recovery services, education services, and cyber resilience managed services. It operates in the United States, Canada, and Latin America, as well as in Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Australia, India, Southeast Asia, and China. Commvault Systems, Inc. was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Tinton Falls, New Jersey.","employees":3300,"website":"https://www.commvault.com","country":"United States","city":"Tinton Falls","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Sanjay  Mirchandani","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Gary  Merrill","title":"Chief Financial Officer"},{"name":"Ms. Danielle  Abrahamsen","title":"Chief Accounting Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.28,"tpe":32.14,"ps":4.713,"pfcf":27.99,"peg":1.155,"pb":4.963,"ev_ebitda":20.13,"rev_growth":0.169,"eps_growth":0.352,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2214,"eps_growth_next":0.1917,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1232,"roa":0.04714,"de":32.58,"gross_margin":0.5282,"op_margin":0.1189,"profit_margin":0.08604,"current_ratio":1.798},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":null,"sector":18.28,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":109.9,"sector":32.14,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":5.712,"sector":4.713,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":22.83,"sector":27.99,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":3.17,"sector":1.155,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":137.4,"sector":4.963,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":7351.0,"sector":32.58,"verdict":"High debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue g